@mock = http://localhost:5288

### Normal
POST {{mock}}/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "delayMs": 0, "failureRate": 0 }

### Flaky: half of the requests fail
POST {{mock}}/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "delayMs": 0, "failureRate": 0.5 }

### Slow: 3 seconds per answer
POST {{mock}}/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "delayMs": 15000, "failureRate": 0 }

### Down: every request fails
POST {{mock}}/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "delayMs": 0, "failureRate": 1 }

### All charges
GET {{mock}}/charges
